sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant UserController
    participant UserService
    participant UserRepository

    Client->>UserController: POST /users/register
    UserController->>UserService: registerUser(userDetails)
    UserService->>UserRepository: save(user)
    UserRepository-->>UserService: user saved
    UserService-->>UserController: registration success
    UserController-->>Client: response with user ID